{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>8月26日（周三）早上，因尼泊爾一側發生泥石流災害，造成西藏日喀則市吉隆縣吉隆口岸受災。截至目前，此次泥石流災害在西藏一側已造成3人遇難、558人失聯。香港01為大家跟進27日（周四）的最新情況。</p><p>10：20</p><p>西藏日喀則市召開的新聞發布會指，截至目前，此次泥石流災害在西藏一側已造成3人遇難、558人失聯，其中外籍人員260人，並成功搜救熱索村民2人。</p><p>09：30</p><p>新華社報道，解放軍西部戰區空軍一架運-20起飛，搭載西部戰區指導組赴西藏，組織解放軍開展日喀則市吉隆縣泥石流災害聯合救援。</p><figure><img alt=\"網傳現場畫面。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260826/1169325779973181440138520.png/bMY2ujw95ogdULiWOb5vNKtg8r-r-KBaqOe0QKjntEA\"/><figcaption>網傳現場畫面。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網傳現場畫面。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260826/1169325777330638848385016.png/OLsV7dJoH30vXDBTVneLPLmgdyj7Dcmi5QDnWOUA51g\"/><figcaption>網傳現場畫面。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網傳現場畫面。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260826/1169325782439563264610354.png/5U6bmzquM0i7xG-hrv-X-zk-b4CUbtI41fZ2htX2doY\"/><figcaption>網傳現場畫面。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西藏山泥傾瀉釀重大人員傷亡。（新華社）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260826/1169328391783059456205681.png/BBs1eZ3kaaVr5MmDKl77OorTC1ObNCg1GvTtHRr07R0\"/><figcaption>西藏山泥傾瀉釀重大人員傷亡。（新華社）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西藏山泥傾瀉釀重大人員傷亡。（新華社）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260826/1169328389589307392210689.png/5EE28hri6NSvwIa8BefKdKnrb_lYoOPrcQDXrHEA16w\"/><figcaption>西藏山泥傾瀉釀重大人員傷亡。（新華社）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西藏山泥傾瀉釀重大人員傷亡。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260826/1169330900585156608567924.png/LzNG0gA1vz2zUT_W_QjsAxRV7U-AtmJvOe82IznvNiM\"/><figcaption>西藏山泥傾瀉釀重大人員傷亡。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西藏山泥傾瀉釀重大人員傷亡。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260826/1169330898278158336104687.png/aA4sZlXsAR6jB7FfbTNU_0B2sa2WPVDMd1b0N3dW9Dc\"/><figcaption>西藏山泥傾瀉釀重大人員傷亡。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西藏山泥傾瀉釀重大人員傷亡。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260826/1169330895862108160573280.png/Ls-jp5bBmOwftoUF2e99FfYMOu4ec-gsXukp1l7pKdY\"/><figcaption>西藏山泥傾瀉釀重大人員傷亡。（截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T03:20:16.942715+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":377,"images":8,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}